# delegation-daily-digest
owner: looker · cadence: review yesterday's batches each morning · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a daily digest of delegation batch outcomes so you can spot owner-exit patterns without digging through logs?**

## Prompt
Scan the Hermes delegation cache and state.db for batches completed in the last 24 hours. Extract: batch ID, fan-out size, role, terminal result, duration if present. If any owner-exit errors are found, note them prominently. Append a 5-bullet digest to topics/dispatched-m2s/wiki/queries/query-index.md.

## Evidence
> Delegation owner exited before recording a terminal result; outcome unknown.
> The batch did not complete successfully
